得でき次第、ここに自動で表示されます。</div><div class=\"nhead\">板・売買フローの推定（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(26年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,91.1 9.1,93.1 14.2,84.9 19.3,80.8 24.5,91.1 29.6,93.1 34.7,91.1 39.8,93.1 44.9,93.1 50.0,93.1 55.1,91.1 60.3,78.7 65.4,70.5 70.5,72.5 75.6,56.0 80.7,64.3 85.8,58.1 91.0,45.7 96.1,54.0 101.2,60.2 106.3,47.8 111.4,68.4 116.5,64.3 121.6,80.8 126.8,97.2 131.9,95.2 137.0,89.0 142.1,72.5 147.2,72.5 152.3,68.4 157.4,70.5 162.6,64.3 167.7,78.7 172.8,80.8 177.9,80.8 183.0,82.8 188.1,91.1 193.2,95.2 198.4,84.9 203.5,62.2 208.6,62.2 213.7,66.3 218.8,54.0 223.9,47.8 229.0,41.6 234.2,16.9 239.3,12.8 244.4,16.9 249.5,45.7 254.6,47.8 259.7,39.5 264.9,31.3 270.0,29.2 275.1,27.2 280.2,27.2 285.3,18.9 290.4,21.0 295.5,21.0 300.7,25.1 305.8,37.5 310.9,39.5 316.0,41.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"41.6\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,44.3 6.1,45.4 8.3,46.6 10.4,58.9 12.5,48.8 14.7,51.1 16.8,55.6 19.0,56.7 21.1,53.3 23.2,55.6 25.4,45.4 27.5,43.2 29.6,38.7 31.8,42.0 33.9,37.5 36.1,55.6 38.2,52.2 40.3,48.